{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4038150/extras/902c4e5f54b2d064242310df6c30d730.avif?t=1760378787\" width=600 height=209 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>YVY is a SHORT fast-paced roguelite based on a single dice customization and autobattler mechanics.</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4038150/extras/7ee88e632dba5ecf81c9daf0263a95be.avif?t=1760378787\" width=610 height=136 /></span> <br><strong>Demo Content</strong><br>In this DEMO you will experience the first chapter of YVY with lots od enemies, a chapter boss and more than 50 skills to build your own dice and your character!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4038150/extras/e0b77cbd9895b27f72ca9748773cf424.poster.avif?t=1760378787\" width=616 height=344 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4038150/extras/e0b77cbd9895b27f72ca9748773cf424.webm?t=1760378787\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4038150/extras/e0b77cbd9895b27f72ca9748773cf424.mp4?t=1760378787\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Forge the perfect dice</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize each face of your dice with unique abilities and see them in action as they are rolled! Strategic dice-building is essential to overcome all challenges that await you.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4038150/extras/3fdfe1a7a375d83b52b4e912d33cf6b1.avif?t=1760378787\" width=598 height=172 /></span><br><strong>The Beginning of a Great Journey</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play the first chapter of YVY to immerse yourself in a rich and challening world, complete with various enemies, skills and the introduction to the Earth's Hand people greatest battle!<br><br><strong>Discover Brazilian Indigenous themes</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The universe of <i>YVY</i> is inspired by indigenous cultures and folklore from Brazil. From music to characters, scenarios, culture, and dialogue, the game provides an opportunity to discover something new and meaningful.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4038150/extras/3aa2537bab5ef8d363c093acccd5db5b.avif?t=1760378787\" width=1560 height=876 /></span><br> </p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4038150?t=1760378787","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4038150/addaa7b3308201bf29a473e08273309c1369663b/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1760378787","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4038150/0ad9444df8d034476869051bab3db862a7b320ce/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760378787","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4038150/0ad9444df8d034476869051bab3db862a7b320ce/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760378787","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Captions available","id":13},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4038150/extras/902c4e5f54b2d064242310df6c30d7